meta {
  name: Seed Demo Store
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/?alondra-webhook=seed_demo_store
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Runs Clear Data first (wipes all tiered pricing groups), then requires and runs
  dev/helper/demo-store/seed.php, which is idempotent: every product, term, user and
  pricing group is resolved by slug/SKU/login/title first, so anything already in place
  reports "unchanged". Restores the seeded wholesale pricing groups a Playwright run's
  Clear Data calls remove.

  No params. Can be slow (image sideloads + regenerates sizes for any missing product
  image) - the E2E fixture gives this call a 5 minute timeout vs. the usual 30s.

  Response data.report is an array of one line per entity the seeder touched.
}
